      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Highlights",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The serum that does the heavy lifting in your routine. Stabilised vitamin C and 5% niacinamide work on the look of dullness and uneven tone, while three weights of hyaluronic acid pull moisture into the skin and hold it there. The texture is weightless — it disappears in seconds and leaves skin looking fresh rather than shiny.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Use morning and night on clean skin, before moisturiser. Press three to four drops into damp skin for the best absorption. In the morning, always follow with SPF. If you're new to vitamin C, start once daily for the first week.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Inside",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Stabilised Vitamin C</strong> — brightens the look of uneven tone.<br/><strong>5% Niacinamide</strong> — refines the appearance of pores and texture.<br/><strong>Multi-Weight Hyaluronic Acid</strong> — hydration at three depths.<br/><strong>Panthenol</strong> — keeps the barrier calm and comfortable.</p><p>Free from fragrance, essential oils and drying alcohol.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "collapsible_row_1",
        "collapsible_row_2",
        "collapsible_row_3"
